{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01St6bY1gzC8ixLUjEs5Ah3r","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '彻底放弃 accuracy improvement claim。Reframe 为： \"Why Symbolic Consensus\n2\t  Fails: A Diagnostic Framework for Constraint-Based LLM Aggregation\"。 核心贡献变为三层：(1)\n3\t  C0 diagnostic framework — 零成本判断任何 consensus method 是否值得部署， (2) 推理模型 vs 指令模型的 trace\n4\t  diversity 根因分析， (3) 对 \"symbolic structure helps reasoning\" 假设的精确化否定条件。 Tiebreak\n5\t  机制的高 win rate 作为 \"method is correct but regime is narrow\" 的证据。 QwQ 负结果从配角升为主角。目标\n6\t  venue 调整为 Findings of EMNLP 或 EMNLP short。\n7\t\n8\t  '\n9\timagined_experiments:\n10\t- name: sica_expanded_14b\n11\t  plan_id: exp-001\n12\t  description: PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    sica_accuracy_combined: 0.695\n15\t    sc_accuracy_combined: 0.688\n16\t    sica_sc_gap_combined_pp: 0.7\n17\t    folio_sica_accuracy: 0.755\n18\t    folio_sc_accuracy: 0.735\n19\t    folio_gap_pp: 2.0\n20\t    proofwriter_sica_accuracy: 0.665\n21\t    proofwriter_sc_accuracy: 0.67\n22\t    proofwriter_gap_pp: -0.5\n23\t    bootstrap_p_combined: 0.32\n24\t    bootstrap_p_folio: 0.18\n25\t    c0_combined: 0.28\n26\t    c0_folio: 0.32\n27\t    c0_proofwriter: 0.25\n28\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.022\n29\t    tie_question_fraction: 0.025\n30\t    tiebreak_triggered_n: ~20\n31\t    tiebreak_win_rate: 0.6\n32\t    wall_time_hours: ~13\n33\t  result_rationale: '60题的C0=53%严重高估了总体diversity。扩展至804题后，大量ProofWriter D5题目对14B而言\n34\t    要么太简单（12/12一致正确）要么模式化错误（12/12一致错误），C0降至25-28%。 FOLIO 204题中约32%有多候选，但多数多候选题的split是9:3或10:2而非6:6，\n35\t    MaxSAT在非tie情况下几乎不改变majority结果（exclusion rate仅2.2%）。 真正的6:6 tie在K=12下约占2.5%（~20题），tiebreak在这20题上win\n36\t    rate约60%， 贡献约0.7pp的combined gap。ProofWriter因其closed-world逻辑的规律性， 14B在大样本上反而因constraint\n37\t    extraction引入微量噪声导致-0.5pp。 Bootstrap p=0.32远未达显著性，confirm了小样本噪声假设。\n38\t\n39\t    '\n40\t  tables:\n41\t  - name: 'Table 2: Expanded Results (804 Questions)'\n42\t    columns:\n43\t    - Domain\n44\t    - N\n45\t    - SC Acc\n46\t    - SICA Acc\n47\t    - Gap (pp)\n48\t    - C0\n49\t    - Ties\n50\t    - p-value\n51\t    rows:\n52\t    - - FOLIO\n53\t      - 204\n54\t      - 73.5%\n55\t      - 75.5%\n56\t      - '+2.0'\n57\t      - '0.32'\n58\t      - 6 (2.9%)\n59\t      - '0.18'\n60\t    - - ProofWriter D5\n61\t      - 600\n62\t      - 67.0%\n63\t      - 66.5%\n64\t      - '-0.5'\n65\t      - '0.25'\n66\t      - 14 (2.3%)\n67\t      - '0.71'\n68\t    - - Combined\n69\t      - 804\n70\t      - 68.8%\n71\t      - 69.5%\n72\t      - '+0.7'\n73\t      - '0.28'\n74\t      - 20 (2.5%)\n75\t      - '0.32'\n76\t    - - D012 (reference)\n77\t      - 60\n78\t      - 70.0%\n79\t      - 73.3%\n80\t      - '+3.3'\n81\t      - '0.53'\n82\t      - 4 (6.7%)\n83\t      - '0.23'\n84\t  figures_description:\n85\t  - 'Fig 2: C0 histogram showing bimodal distribution — FOLIO questions cluster at\n86\t    C0>0.3 and C0=0, ProofWriter heavily concentrated at C0=0'\n87\t  - 'Fig 3: Per-question SICA-SC difference vs C0, showing gain concentrated in C0>0.4\n88\t    band but high variance'\n89\t  analysis: '关键发现：60题D012样本的C0=53%是selection bias——那60题本身就是从pilot中挑出的 有趣/困难题目。扩展到完整benchmark后，绝大多数题对14B-Instruct而言diversity不足。\n90\t    SICA的正确性在tie scenario中得到验证（60% win rate > 25% random baseline）， 但tie场景太少（2.5%）导致aggregate\n91\t    gain不显著。 这直接支持reframe：方法正确但operating regime狭窄。\n92\t\n93\t    '\n94\t- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n95\t  plan_id: exp-002\n96\t  description: K=6,8,12,16,20 on D012's 60 questions, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n97\t  expected_results:\n98\t    k6_gap_pp: 1.7\n99\t    k6_c0: 0.4\n100\t    k6_tie_fraction: 0.033\n101\t    k8_gap_pp: 0.0\n102\t    k8_c0: 0.45\n103\t    k8_tie_fraction: 0.017\n104\t    k12_gap_pp: 3.3\n105\t    k12_c0: 0.53\n106\t    k12_tie_fraction: 0.067\n107\t    k16_gap_pp: 1.7\n108\t    k16_c0: 0.55\n109\t    k16_tie_fraction: 0.033\n110\t    k20_gap_pp: 0.0\n111\t    k20_c0: 0.58\n112\t    k20_tie_fraction: 0.017\n113\t    best_k: 12\n114\t    best_gap_pp: 3.3\n115\t    odd_k_gap_pp: 0.0\n116\t    correlation_c0_gap: 0.35\n117\t  result_rationale: \"K ablation在worst档下揭示SICA gain完全是tie-driven artifact： - K=12恰好是唯一在这60题上产生较多even-split\\\n118\t    \\ tie的值（4题=6.7%） - K=6时tie需要3:3，概率更低但发生1-2次；K=8需要4:4，几乎不发生 - K=16/20时，larger sample使majority更稳定，tie概率指数下降\\\n119\t    \\ - C0随K单调增加（更多samples→更可能出现minority answer），但tie fraction\\n  不单调——它取决于specific\\\n120\t    \\ split概率\\n- 如果测试odd K（K=7,9,11），tie在majority voting下数学上不可能，gap=0 这证明SICA的gain机制是且仅是tiebreaking，没有通过constraint\\\n121\t    \\ weighting 在非tie场景改变outcome。MaxSAT exclusion在所有K下都<3%， 从未翻转过一个non-tie majority。\\n\"\n122\t  tables:\n123\t  - name: 'Table 3: K Sensitivity Analysis'\n124\t    columns:\n125\t    - K\n126\t    - C0\n127\t    - Tie Fraction\n128\t    - SICA Acc\n129\t    - SC Acc\n130\t    - Gap (pp)\n131\t    - Exclusion Rate\n132\t    rows:\n133\t    - - 6\n134\t      - 40%\n135\t      - 3.3%\n136\t      - 71.7%\n137\t      - 70.0%\n138\t      - '+1.7'\n139\t      - 2.8%\n140\t    - - 8\n141\t      - 45%\n142\t      - 1.7%\n143\t      - 70.0%\n144\t      - 70.0%\n145\t      - '0.0'\n146\t      - 2.5%\n147\t    - - 12\n148\t      - 53%\n149\t      - 6.7%\n150\t      - 73.3%\n151\t      - 70.0%\n152\t      - '+3.3'\n153\t      - 2.6%\n154\t    - - 16\n155\t      - 55%\n156\t      - 3.3%\n157\t      - 71.7%\n158\t      - 70.0%\n159\t      - '+1.7'\n160\t      - 2.4%\n161\t    - - 20\n162\t      - 58%\n163\t      - 1.7%\n164\t      - 70.0%\n165\t      - 70.0%\n166\t      - '0.0'\n167\t      - 2.2%\n168\t  figures_description:\n169\t  - 'Fig 4: K vs Gap (pp) showing non-monotonic pattern — gap spikes only where tie\n170\t    fraction happens to be high, not where C0 is highest'\n171\t  - 'Fig 5: Tie probability theoretical curve (binomial) vs observed, showing K=12\n172\t    is near-optimal for tie generation but still produces ties on <7% of questions'\n173\t  analysis: 'K ablation是worst档的核心evidence：它证明SICA gain完全由tie frequency决定， 而非由constraint\n174\t    quality或MaxSAT reasoning决定。C0和gap的相关性仅0.35， 因为C0测量的是diversity存在性，而gain需要diversity恰好50:50。\n175\t    这支持reframe中的\"method is correct but regime is narrow\"论点。 Paper中应呈现为\"SICA''s mechanism\n176\t    activates only at exact vote parity\"。\n177\t\n178\t    '\n179\t- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n180\t  plan_id: exp-003\n181\t  description: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic on all available data (exp-001\n182\t    results)\n183\t  expected_results:\n184\t    expanded_tie_questions_n: 20\n185\t    sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.6\n186\t    random_tiebreak_expected_accuracy: 0.5\n187\t    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.45\n188\t    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.4\n189\t    sica_vs_random_gap_on_ties_pp: 10.0\n190\t    sica_vs_random_gap_overall_pp: 0.25\n191\t    binomial_p_sica_vs_random: 0.25\n192\t  result_rationale: '在expanded 804题上，tie仅~20题。SICA在这20题上60% accuracy（12/20正确）， random\n193\t    baseline期望50%（10/20），差距仅2题。Binomial test p=0.25（20次试验中 观察12+ success vs null=0.5），远不显著。\n194\t    虽然per-tie的win rate（60%>50%）方向正确，但： (1) 样本太小无法统计确认优势 (2) 即使优势真实，对overall accuracy贡献仅0.25pp（20题×10%÷804题）\n195\t    Alphabetical/first-seen表现更差验证了\"任意tiebreak确实有害\"，但SICA的优势 幅度太小且统计不显著。这是\"correct\n196\t    but narrow\"的直接数字化呈现。\n197\t\n198\t    '\n199\t  tables:\n200\t  - name: 'Table 4: Tiebreak Strategy Comparison (Tie Questions Only)'\n201\t    columns:\n202\t    - Strategy\n203\t    - Acc on Ties (N=20)\n204\t    - Overall Acc (N=804)\n205\t    - vs Random (pp)\n206\t    rows:\n207\t    - - SICA (MaxSAT weighted)\n208\t      - 60.0%\n209\t      - 69.5%\n210\t      - '+0.25'\n211\t    - - Random (expected)\n212\t      - 50.0%\n213\t      - 69.3%\n214\t      - —\n215\t    - - Alphabetical\n216\t      - 45.0%\n217\t      - 69.1%\n218\t      - '-0.12'\n219\t    - - First-seen\n220\t      - 40.0%\n221\t      - 69.0%\n222\t      - '-0.25'\n223\t  figures_description:\n224\t  - 'Fig 6: Tiebreak accuracy comparison with 95% CI error bars — all strategies''\n225\t    CIs overlap heavily due to N=20'\n226\t  analysis: 'Tiebreak analysis在worst档下支撑的narrative是：SICA作为tiebreak mechanism 方向正确（优于random和deterministic），但operating\n227\t    regime（tie frequency=2.5%） 使其对aggregate performance的贡献可以忽略。 Paper framing：不claim\n228\t    accuracy gain，而是用tiebreak win rate作为 \"symbolic constraints carry real information\"的evidence，然后pivot到\n229\t    \"but the regime where this information matters is vanishingly narrow for current\n230\t    models\"。\n231\t\n232\t    '\n233\t- name: sica_7b_scaling\n234\t  plan_id: exp-004\n235\t  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on same 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\n236\t  expected_results:\n237\t    sc_accuracy: 0.583\n238\t    sica_accuracy: 0.6\n239\t    sica_sc_gap_pp: 1.7\n240\t    c0_multi_candidate_rate: 0.65\n241\t    tie_fraction: 0.1\n242\t    tiebreak_win_rate: 0.5\n243\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.018\n244\t    constraint_quality_score: 0.45\n245\t    extraction_failure_rate: 0.12\n246\t  result_rationale: '7B模型验证了C0-as-predictor的方向性（C0=65% > 14B的53%），但在worst档下 暴露了C0的insufficiency：更高的diversity不一定转化为更大的SICA\n247\t    gain。 原因：7B的constraint extraction质量显著下降——更弱的模型生成的reasoning traces 逻辑结构更松散，extracted\n248\t    FOL constraints更多是malformed或语义空洞的， MaxSAT weighting基于低质量constraints做出的决策不比random好。\n249\t    Tie fraction确实更高（10% vs 6.7%），但tiebreak win rate降至chance level（50%）， 因为constraint信号被noise淹没。最终gap仅1.7pp且完全不显著。\n250\t    这对paper的贡献：C0是necessary but not sufficient condition—— 还需要constraint quality（隐含model\n251\t    capability threshold）。\n252\t\n253\t    '\n254\t  tables:\n255\t  - name: 'Table 5: Model Scaling and C0'\n256\t    columns:\n257\t    - Model\n258\t    - Params\n259\t    - SC Acc\n260\t    - C0\n261\t    - Tie%\n262\t    - Tiebreak WR\n263\t    - Gap (pp)\n264\t    rows:\n265\t    - - QwQ-32B\n266\t      - 32B (reasoning)\n267\t      - 72.7%\n268\t      - '0.036'\n269\t      - 0%\n270\t      - N/A\n271\t      - '0.0'\n272\t    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n273\t      - 14B\n274\t      - 70.0%\n275\t      - '0.53'\n276\t      - 6.7%\n277\t      - 75%\n278\t      - '+3.3'\n279\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n280\t      - 7B\n281\t      - 58.3%\n282\t      - '0.65'\n283\t      - 10%\n284\t      - 50%\n285\t      - '+1.7'\n286\t  figures_description:\n287\t  - 'Fig 7: Model capability vs C0 vs SICA gap — showing inverted-U relationship where\n288\t    optimal SICA regime requires both sufficient diversity AND sufficient constraint\n289\t    quality'\n290\t  analysis: '7B结果在worst档下是double-edged：一方面验证了C0与model type的关系（weaker→more diverse），\n291\t    另一方面破坏了C0作为单一predictor的简洁narrative。需要引入constraint quality 作为second axis，使C0 diagnostic\n292\t    framework从\"单指标预测\"退化为\"必要条件判断\"。 对reframed paper仍有价值：强化了\"operating regime is narrow\"的结论——\n293\t    不仅需要diversity，还需要diversity来自有能力产生valid constraints的模型。\n294\t\n295\t    '\n296\t- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n297\t  plan_id: exp-005\n298\t  description: QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\n299\t  expected_results:\n300\t    aime_c0: 0.0\n301\t    aime_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n302\t    folio_c0: 0.0\n303\t    folio_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n304\t    proofwriter_c0: 0.1875\n305\t    proofwriter_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n306\t    combined_c0: 0.036\n307\t    combined_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n308\t    n_total: 48\n309\t    reasoning_model_conclusion: SICA structurally degenerates to SC\n310\t  result_rationale: 'QwQ数据已存在且确认worst档预设：reasoning model的chain-of-thought过程 产生near-deterministic答案（temperature\n311\t    sampling无法穿透reasoning chain的 self-correction机制）。C0=3.6%意味着在48题中仅1-2题出现过多候选答案，\n312\t    且这些多候选情况可能是reasoning chain的中间犹豫而非genuine uncertainty。 SICA≡SC是数学必然：当只有1个candidate\n313\t    answer时，MaxSAT无论怎么weight都选它。 这是worst档narrative的strongest evidence——\"method correctness\n314\t    is irrelevant  when the operating regime doesn''t exist\"。\n315\t\n316\t    '\n317\t  tables:\n318\t  - name: 'Table 6: Reasoning vs Instruction Model Operating Regime'\n319\t    columns:\n320\t    - Model\n321\t    - Type\n322\t    - Domain\n323\t    - N\n324\t    - C0\n325\t    - SICA-SC Gap\n326\t    rows:\n327\t    - - QwQ-32B\n328\t      - Reasoning\n329\t      - AIME\n330\t      - 22\n331\t      - 0%\n332\t      - 0.0pp\n333\t    - - QwQ-32B\n334\t      - Reasoning\n335\t      - FOLIO\n336\t      - 10\n337\t      - 0%\n338\t      - 0.0pp\n339\t    - - QwQ-32B\n340\t      - Reasoning\n341\t      - ProofWriter\n342\t      - 16\n343\t      - 18.75%\n344\t      - 0.0pp\n345\t    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n346\t      - Instruction\n347\t      - FOLIO\n348\t      - 30\n349\t      - 40%\n350\t      - +6.7pp\n351\t    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n352\t      - Instruction\n353\t      - ProofWriter\n354\t      - 30\n355\t      - 63%\n356\t      - 0.0pp\n357\t    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n358\t      - Instruction\n359\t      - Combined\n360\t      - 60\n361\t      - 53%\n362\t      - +3.3pp\n363\t  figures_description:\n364\t  - 'Fig 1 (main): Operating regime diagram — x-axis: C0 (trace diversity), y-axis:\n365\t    SICA-SC gap. Reasoning models clustered at origin, instruction models spread along\n366\t    x-axis but gap only positive for FOLIO subset'\n367\t  analysis: 'QwQ data在worst档下从\"negative result配角\"升为\"主要贡献\"。 Framing：不是\"SICA在reasoning\n368\t    model上失败\"，而是\"我们发现了一个fundamental architectural property——reasoning models的internal\n369\t    self-consistency消除了 external consensus的操作空间\"。这个发现对ALL ensemble/consensus methods成立，\n370\t    不限于SICA，是architecturally general的insight。 Paper中应作为Section 4的opening，建立\"operating\n371\t    regime\"概念后再展示14B数据。\n372\t\n373\t    '\n374\t- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n375\t  plan_id: exp-006\n376\t  description: Plot C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models and K values\n377\t  expected_results:\n378\t    n_datapoints: 12\n379\t    pearson_r_c0_gap: 0.45\n380\t    spearman_rho_c0_gap: 0.52\n381\t    c0_threshold_for_positive_gap: 0.3\n382\t    false_positive_rate: 0.25\n383\t    false_negative_rate: 0.1\n384\t    auc_c0_as_classifier: 0.72\n385\t  result_rationale: '在worst档下，C0 vs gap的关系存在但不strong： - QwQ数据点（C0≈0, gap=0）锚定了左下角\n386\t    - 14B-Instruct K=12 60题（C0=0.53, gap=3.3）是outlier（小样本噪声放大） - 14B-Instruct 804题（C0=0.28,\n387\t    gap=0.7）落在中间偏低 - 7B（C0=0.65, gap=1.7）比14B 804题高但不如14B 60题 - K ablation各点散布较广 Pearson\n388\t    r≈0.45说明C0解释了约20%的variance——有信号但不是strong predictor。 作为binary classifier（C0>0.3\n389\t    → SICA有价值），AUC=0.72——比random好但远非 definitive。这将C0从\"precise diagnostic\"降级为\"rough\n390\t    screening heuristic\"。 在worst档narrative中，这恰好支持\"characterization贡献\"而非\"practical\n391\t    tool\"。\n392\t\n393\t    '\n394\t  tables:\n395\t  - name: 'Table 7: C0 as Diagnostic — Correlation Analysis'\n396\t    columns:\n397\t    - Condition\n398\t    - C0\n399\t    - Gap (pp)\n400\t    - N\n401\t    rows:\n402\t    - - QwQ-32B Combined\n403\t      - 0.036\n404\t      - 0.0\n405\t      - 48\n406\t    - - 14B FOLIO-60\n407\t      - 0.4\n408\t      - 6.7\n409\t      - 30\n410\t    - - 14B PW-60\n411\t      - 0.63\n412\t      - 0.0\n413\t      - 30\n414\t    - - 14B Combined-60\n415\t      - 0.53\n416\t      - 3.3\n417\t      - 60\n418\t    - - 14B FOLIO-204\n419\t      - 0.32\n420\t      - 2.0\n421\t      - 204\n422\t    - - 14B PW-600\n423\t      - 0.25\n424\t      - -0.5\n425\t      - 600\n426\t    - - 14B Combined-804\n427\t      - 0.28\n428\t      - 0.7\n429\t      - 804\n430\t    - - 7B Combined-60\n431\t      - 0.65\n432\t      - 1.7\n433\t      - 60\n434\t    - - 14B K=6\n435\t      - 0.4\n436\t      - 1.7\n437\t      - 60\n438\t    - - 14B K=8\n439\t      - 0.45\n440\t      - 0.0\n441\t      - 60\n442\t    - - 14B K=16\n443\t      - 0.55\n444\t      - 1.7\n445\t      - 60\n446\t    - - 14B K=20\n447\t      - 0.58\n448\t      - 0.0\n449\t      - 60\n450\t  figures_description:\n451\t  - 'Fig 8: Scatter plot C0 vs Gap with regression line — showing positive but weak\n452\t    correlation (r=0.45), with ProofWriter points systematically below regression\n453\t    line'\n454\t  - 'Fig 9: C0 as binary classifier ROC curve (threshold sweep), AUC=0.72'\n455\t  analysis: 'C0 diagnostic在worst档下的贡献从\"practical zero-cost tool\"退化为 \"necessary condition\n456\t    identifier\"——C0<5%确实predicts gap=0（无false negatives in that range），但C0>30%不guarantee\n457\t    positive gap（ProofWriter反例）。 Paper framing：C0的价值是快速排除不值得尝试的场景（reasoning models），\n458\t    而非精确预测gain magnitude。这仍是有价值的practitioner insight， 但claim需要significantly weaken。\n459\t\n460\t    '\n461\t- name: sica_72b_awq\n462\t  plan_id: exp-007\n463\t  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\n464\t  expected_results:\n465\t    sc_accuracy: 0.783\n466\t    sica_accuracy: 0.783\n467\t    sica_sc_gap_pp: 0.0\n468\t    c0_multi_candidate_rate: 0.18\n469\t    tie_fraction: 0.017\n470\t    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.015\n471\t    constraint_quality_score: 0.82\n472\t    wall_time_hours: 3.5\n473\t  result_rationale: '72B模型在worst档下表现接近reasoning model regime： 更强的instruction model更self-consistent（虽非reasoning\n474\t    architecture， 但72B的internal representation足够强大以produce near-deterministic outputs）。\n475\t    C0=18%接近worst档定义的lower bound，tie fraction仅1题（1.7%）。 高constraint quality（0.82）但无用武之地——当多数题12/12一致时，\n476\t    即使constraints完美也无法改变outcome。Gap=0pp。 这对paper的贡献：在7B-14B-72B-QwQ的spectrum上， 展示了C0与model\n477\t    capability的inverse relationship不限于reasoning vs instruction的 binary divide，而是continuous\n478\t    spectrum。72B是\"instruction model approaching  reasoning model regime\"的evidence。\n479\t\n480\t    '\n481\t  tables:\n482\t  - name: 'Table 5 (extended): Full Model Scaling'\n483\t    columns:\n484\t    - Model\n485\t    - Params\n486\t    - Type\n487\t    - SC Acc\n488\t    - C0\n489\t    - Gap (pp)\n490\t    rows:\n491\t    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n492\t      - 7B\n493\t      - Instruction\n494\t      - 58.3%\n495\t      - '0.65'\n496\t      - '+1.7'\n497\t    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n498\t      - 14B\n499\t      - Instruction\n500\t      - 70.0%\n501\t      - '0.53'\n502\t      - '+3.3'\n503\t    - - Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\n504\t      - 72B\n505\t      - Instruction\n506\t      - 78.3%\n507\t      - '0.18'\n508\t      - '0.0'\n509\t    - - QwQ-32B\n510\t      - 32B\n511\t      - Reasoning\n512\t      - 72.7%\n513\t      - '0.036'\n514\t      - '0.0'\n515\t  figures_description:\n516\t  - 'Fig 10: Model scale vs C0 showing clear negative log-linear trend for instruction\n517\t    models, with reasoning model as extreme endpoint'\n518\t  analysis: '72B结果在worst档下是devastating for accuracy claim但excellent for characterization：\n519\t    它证明SICA的operating regime不仅排除reasoning models，还排除sufficiently capable instruction\n520\t    models。实际有效的窗口是\"14B-class instruction models on specific  diverse-inducing tasks\"——一个非常narrow的niche。\n521\t    对reframed paper：这是operating regime分析的crown jewel数据点， 证明了regime narrowness是model\n522\t    capability的函数而非architecture的binary。\n523\t\n524\t    '\n525\t- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n526\t  plan_id: exp-008\n527\t  description: Qualitative analysis of extracted constraints on 5-10 representative\n528\t    questions\n529\t  expected_results:\n530\t    semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.55\n531\t    trivially_correct_rate: 0.3\n532\t    malformed_or_vacuous_rate: 0.15\n533\t    exclusion_justified_rate: 0.7\n534\t    case_study_n: 8\n535\t    finding: Constraints are often restatements of the answer rather than independent\n536\t      logical evidence\n537\t  result_rationale: '在worst档下，constraint quality analysis揭示了SICA的deeper limitation：\n538\t    多数extracted constraints不是独立于answer的logical evidence，而是answer的 reformulation（\"if\n539\t    answer is A then X holds\" → tautological when answer IS A）。 真正的inter-answer constraints（\"A\n540\t    and B cannot both be true because...\"）占少数。 MaxSAT exclusion（当它发生时）确实对应reasoning\n541\t    errors（70% justified）， 但exclusion rate太低（2-3%）说明大多数constraints不互相矛盾—— 它们各自支持自己的answer而不cross-reference\n542\t    other candidates。 这解释了为什么MaxSAT在非tie场景无法翻转majority：constraints是answer-local的，\n543\t    不提供cross-answer的discriminative信号。\n544\t\n545\t    '\n546\t  tables: []\n547\t  figures_description:\n548\t  - 'Fig 11: Example constraint extraction showing tautological vs genuinely discriminative\n549\t    constraints, with annotation of semantic categories'\n550\t  analysis: 'Case studies在worst档下支持一个deep methodological critique： current constraint\n551\t    extraction paradigm produces answer-local evidence而非 cross-answer comparative\n552\t    evidence。这不是implementation bug而是architectural limitation——LLM traces naturally\n553\t    argue FOR their conclusion而非AGAINST alternatives。 对reframed paper：这是\"why symbolic\n554\t    consensus fails\"的mechanistic explanation， 升级为Section 5的核心内容。\n555\t\n556\t    '\n557\t- name: overhead_analysis\n558\t  plan_id: exp-009\n559\t  description: 'Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT'\n560\t  expected_results:\n561\t    avg_total_time_per_question_s: 58.3\n562\t    generation_fraction: 0.85\n563\t    extraction_fraction: 0.12\n564\t    maxsat_fraction: 0.03\n565\t    overhead_vs_sc_multiplier: 1.15\n566\t    extraction_api_calls_per_question: 12\n567\t    maxsat_solve_time_ms: 45\n568\t    overall_cost_multiplier_vs_sc: 2.2\n569\t  result_rationale: 'Overhead analysis在worst档下呈现矛盾narrative： computational overhead其实不大（MaxSAT本身仅3%的时间），\n570\t    主要cost是constraint extraction的额外LLM calls（每题12次extraction call， 约等于generation cost×1）。总cost是SC的2.2倍。\n571\t    在gain=0.7pp且不显著的情况下，任何>1x的overhead都是cost-ineffective的。 但如果reframe为diagnostic tool，overhead的framing变化：\n572\t    \"C0 computation需要0 overhead（只看SC投票分布）， full SICA pipeline的overhead仅在C0>threshold时才值得incur\"。\n573\t    这支持了two-stage deployment strategy的practical recommendation。\n574\t\n575\t    '\n576\t  tables:\n577\t  - name: 'Table 8: Computational Overhead Breakdown'\n578\t    columns:\n579\t    - Stage\n580\t    - Avg Time (s)\n581\t    - Fraction\n582\t    - Cost vs SC\n583\t    rows:\n584\t    - - Generation (K=12 traces)\n585\t      - 49.5\n586\t      - 85%\n587\t      - 1.0x (same as SC)\n588\t    - - Constraint Extraction\n589\t      - 7.0\n590\t      - 12%\n591\t      - +1.0x (12 LLM calls)\n592\t    - - MaxSAT Solving\n593\t      - 1.8\n594\t      - 3%\n595\t      - negligible\n596\t    - - Total SICA\n597\t      - 58.3\n598\t      - 100%\n599\t      - 2.2x vs SC\n600\t  figures_description:\n601\t  - 'Fig 12: Stacked bar chart of per-question time breakdown, showing generation\n602\t    dominates and MaxSAT is negligible'\n603\t  analysis: Overhead结果在worst档下的silver lining：MaxSAT本身几乎free（45ms）， bottleneck完全在constraint\n604\t    extraction的LLM calls。 这为future work开路：如果extraction可以更高效（batch, smaller model,  或integrated\n605\t    into generation prompt），SICA的marginal cost可降至接近零。 对reframed paper：overhead不是致命弱点（不像some\n606\t    symbolic methods需要 exponential time），而是engineering problem。主要weakness仍是regime\n607\t    narrowness， 不是computational cost。\n608\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8f20b57d-9fbb-4d3c-afd1-df001eab1b14","uuid":"a39ec057-b18f-47c3-9c4a-4734310d1094","timestamp":"2026-05-16T06:24:36.142Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0513_3/projects/symb_invariant_consensus/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T054054/worst/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '彻底放弃 accuracy improvement claim。Reframe 为： \"Why Symbolic Consensus\n  Fails: A Diagnostic Framework for Constraint-Based LLM Aggregation\"。 核心贡献变为三层：(1)\n  C0 diagnostic framework — 零成本判断任何 consensus method 是否值得部署， (2) 推理模型 vs 指令模型的 trace\n  diversity 根因分析， (3) 对 \"symbolic structure helps reasoning\" 假设的精确化否定条件。 Tiebreak\n  机制的高 win rate 作为 \"method is correct but regime is narrow\" 的证据。 QwQ 负结果从配角升为主角。目标\n  venue 调整为 Findings of EMNLP 或 EMNLP short。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: sica_expanded_14b\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: PW D5 600 + FOLIO 204 = 804 questions, K=12, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n  expected_results:\n    sica_accuracy_combined: 0.695\n    sc_accuracy_combined: 0.688\n    sica_sc_gap_combined_pp: 0.7\n    folio_sica_accuracy: 0.755\n    folio_sc_accuracy: 0.735\n    folio_gap_pp: 2.0\n    proofwriter_sica_accuracy: 0.665\n    proofwriter_sc_accuracy: 0.67\n    proofwriter_gap_pp: -0.5\n    bootstrap_p_combined: 0.32\n    bootstrap_p_folio: 0.18\n    c0_combined: 0.28\n    c0_folio: 0.32\n    c0_proofwriter: 0.25\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.022\n    tie_question_fraction: 0.025\n    tiebreak_triggered_n: ~20\n    tiebreak_win_rate: 0.6\n    wall_time_hours: ~13\n  result_rationale: '60题的C0=53%严重高估了总体diversity。扩展至804题后，大量ProofWriter D5题目对14B而言\n    要么太简单（12/12一致正确）要么模式化错误（12/12一致错误），C0降至25-28%。 FOLIO 204题中约32%有多候选，但多数多候选题的split是9:3或10:2而非6:6，\n    MaxSAT在非tie情况下几乎不改变majority结果（exclusion rate仅2.2%）。 真正的6:6 tie在K=12下约占2.5%（~20题），tiebreak在这20题上win\n    rate约60%， 贡献约0.7pp的combined gap。ProofWriter因其closed-world逻辑的规律性， 14B在大样本上反而因constraint\n    extraction引入微量噪声导致-0.5pp。 Bootstrap p=0.32远未达显著性，confirm了小样本噪声假设。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Expanded Results (804 Questions)'\n    columns:\n    - Domain\n    - N\n    - SC Acc\n    - SICA Acc\n    - Gap (pp)\n    - C0\n    - Ties\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - FOLIO\n      - 204\n      - 73.5%\n      - 75.5%\n      - '+2.0'\n      - '0.32'\n      - 6 (2.9%)\n      - '0.18'\n    - - ProofWriter D5\n      - 600\n      - 67.0%\n      - 66.5%\n      - '-0.5'\n      - '0.25'\n      - 14 (2.3%)\n      - '0.71'\n    - - Combined\n      - 804\n      - 68.8%\n      - 69.5%\n      - '+0.7'\n      - '0.28'\n      - 20 (2.5%)\n      - '0.32'\n    - - D012 (reference)\n      - 60\n      - 70.0%\n      - 73.3%\n      - '+3.3'\n      - '0.53'\n      - 4 (6.7%)\n      - '0.23'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2: C0 histogram showing bimodal distribution — FOLIO questions cluster at\n    C0>0.3 and C0=0, ProofWriter heavily concentrated at C0=0'\n  - 'Fig 3: Per-question SICA-SC difference vs C0, showing gain concentrated in C0>0.4\n    band but high variance'\n  analysis: '关键发现：60题D012样本的C0=53%是selection bias——那60题本身就是从pilot中挑出的 有趣/困难题目。扩展到完整benchmark后，绝大多数题对14B-Instruct而言diversity不足。\n    SICA的正确性在tie scenario中得到验证（60% win rate > 25% random baseline）， 但tie场景太少（2.5%）导致aggregate\n    gain不显著。 这直接支持reframe：方法正确但operating regime狭窄。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_k_ablation_14b\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: K=6,8,12,16,20 on D012's 60 questions, T=0.7, Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n  expected_results:\n    k6_gap_pp: 1.7\n    k6_c0: 0.4\n    k6_tie_fraction: 0.033\n    k8_gap_pp: 0.0\n    k8_c0: 0.45\n    k8_tie_fraction: 0.017\n    k12_gap_pp: 3.3\n    k12_c0: 0.53\n    k12_tie_fraction: 0.067\n    k16_gap_pp: 1.7\n    k16_c0: 0.55\n    k16_tie_fraction: 0.033\n    k20_gap_pp: 0.0\n    k20_c0: 0.58\n    k20_tie_fraction: 0.017\n    best_k: 12\n    best_gap_pp: 3.3\n    odd_k_gap_pp: 0.0\n    correlation_c0_gap: 0.35\n  result_rationale: \"K ablation在worst档下揭示SICA gain完全是tie-driven artifact： - K=12恰好是唯一在这60题上产生较多even-split\\\n    \\ tie的值（4题=6.7%） - K=6时tie需要3:3，概率更低但发生1-2次；K=8需要4:4，几乎不发生 - K=16/20时，larger sample使majority更稳定，tie概率指数下降\\\n    \\ - C0随K单调增加（更多samples→更可能出现minority answer），但tie fraction\\n  不单调——它取决于specific\\\n    \\ split概率\\n- 如果测试odd K（K=7,9,11），tie在majority voting下数学上不可能，gap=0 这证明SICA的gain机制是且仅是tiebreaking，没有通过constraint\\\n    \\ weighting 在非tie场景改变outcome。MaxSAT exclusion在所有K下都<3%， 从未翻转过一个non-tie majority。\\n\"\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: K Sensitivity Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - K\n    - C0\n    - Tie Fraction\n    - SICA Acc\n    - SC Acc\n    - Gap (pp)\n    - Exclusion Rate\n    rows:\n    - - 6\n      - 40%\n      - 3.3%\n      - 71.7%\n      - 70.0%\n      - '+1.7'\n      - 2.8%\n    - - 8\n      - 45%\n      - 1.7%\n      - 70.0%\n      - 70.0%\n      - '0.0'\n      - 2.5%\n    - - 12\n      - 53%\n      - 6.7%\n      - 73.3%\n      - 70.0%\n      - '+3.3'\n      - 2.6%\n    - - 16\n      - 55%\n      - 3.3%\n      - 71.7%\n      - 70.0%\n      - '+1.7'\n      - 2.4%\n    - - 20\n      - 58%\n      - 1.7%\n      - 70.0%\n      - 70.0%\n      - '0.0'\n      - 2.2%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: K vs Gap (pp) showing non-monotonic pattern — gap spikes only where tie\n    fraction happens to be high, not where C0 is highest'\n  - 'Fig 5: Tie probability theoretical curve (binomial) vs observed, showing K=12\n    is near-optimal for tie generation but still produces ties on <7% of questions'\n  analysis: 'K ablation是worst档的核心evidence：它证明SICA gain完全由tie frequency决定， 而非由constraint\n    quality或MaxSAT reasoning决定。C0和gap的相关性仅0.35， 因为C0测量的是diversity存在性，而gain需要diversity恰好50:50。\n    这支持reframe中的\"method is correct but regime is narrow\"论点。 Paper中应呈现为\"SICA''s mechanism\n    activates only at exact vote parity\"。\n\n    '\n- name: tiebreak_baseline_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: SICA vs SC-random vs SC-deterministic on all available data (exp-001\n    results)\n  expected_results:\n    expanded_tie_questions_n: 20\n    sica_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.6\n    random_tiebreak_expected_accuracy: 0.5\n    alphabetical_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.45\n    first_seen_tiebreak_accuracy: 0.4\n    sica_vs_random_gap_on_ties_pp: 10.0\n    sica_vs_random_gap_overall_pp: 0.25\n    binomial_p_sica_vs_random: 0.25\n  result_rationale: '在expanded 804题上，tie仅~20题。SICA在这20题上60% accuracy（12/20正确）， random\n    baseline期望50%（10/20），差距仅2题。Binomial test p=0.25（20次试验中 观察12+ success vs null=0.5），远不显著。\n    虽然per-tie的win rate（60%>50%）方向正确，但： (1) 样本太小无法统计确认优势 (2) 即使优势真实，对overall accuracy贡献仅0.25pp（20题×10%÷804题）\n    Alphabetical/first-seen表现更差验证了\"任意tiebreak确实有害\"，但SICA的优势 幅度太小且统计不显著。这是\"correct\n    but narrow\"的直接数字化呈现。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: Tiebreak Strategy Comparison (Tie Questions Only)'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Acc on Ties (N=20)\n    - Overall Acc (N=804)\n    - vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - SICA (MaxSAT weighted)\n      - 60.0%\n      - 69.5%\n      - '+0.25'\n    - - Random (expected)\n      - 50.0%\n      - 69.3%\n      - —\n    - - Alphabetical\n      - 45.0%\n      - 69.1%\n      - '-0.12'\n    - - First-seen\n      - 40.0%\n      - 69.0%\n      - '-0.25'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: Tiebreak accuracy comparison with 95% CI error bars — all strategies''\n    CIs overlap heavily due to N=20'\n  analysis: 'Tiebreak analysis在worst档下支撑的narrative是：SICA作为tiebreak mechanism 方向正确（优于random和deterministic），但operating\n    regime（tie frequency=2.5%） 使其对aggregate performance的贡献可以忽略。 Paper framing：不claim\n    accuracy gain，而是用tiebreak win rate作为 \"symbolic constraints carry real information\"的evidence，然后pivot到\n    \"but the regime where this information matters is vanishingly narrow for current\n    models\"。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_7b_scaling\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct on same 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\n  expected_results:\n    sc_accuracy: 0.583\n    sica_accuracy: 0.6\n    sica_sc_gap_pp: 1.7\n    c0_multi_candidate_rate: 0.65\n    tie_fraction: 0.1\n    tiebreak_win_rate: 0.5\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.018\n    constraint_quality_score: 0.45\n    extraction_failure_rate: 0.12\n  result_rationale: '7B模型验证了C0-as-predictor的方向性（C0=65% > 14B的53%），但在worst档下 暴露了C0的insufficiency：更高的diversity不一定转化为更大的SICA\n    gain。 原因：7B的constraint extraction质量显著下降——更弱的模型生成的reasoning traces 逻辑结构更松散，extracted\n    FOL constraints更多是malformed或语义空洞的， MaxSAT weighting基于低质量constraints做出的决策不比random好。\n    Tie fraction确实更高（10% vs 6.7%），但tiebreak win rate降至chance level（50%）， 因为constraint信号被noise淹没。最终gap仅1.7pp且完全不显著。\n    这对paper的贡献：C0是necessary but not sufficient condition—— 还需要constraint quality（隐含model\n    capability threshold）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Model Scaling and C0'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Params\n    - SC Acc\n    - C0\n    - Tie%\n    - Tiebreak WR\n    - Gap (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - QwQ-32B\n      - 32B (reasoning)\n      - 72.7%\n      - '0.036'\n      - 0%\n      - N/A\n      - '0.0'\n    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n      - 14B\n      - 70.0%\n      - '0.53'\n      - 6.7%\n      - 75%\n      - '+3.3'\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      - 7B\n      - 58.3%\n      - '0.65'\n      - 10%\n      - 50%\n      - '+1.7'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: Model capability vs C0 vs SICA gap — showing inverted-U relationship where\n    optimal SICA regime requires both sufficient diversity AND sufficient constraint\n    quality'\n  analysis: '7B结果在worst档下是double-edged：一方面验证了C0与model type的关系（weaker→more diverse），\n    另一方面破坏了C0作为单一predictor的简洁narrative。需要引入constraint quality 作为second axis，使C0 diagnostic\n    framework从\"单指标预测\"退化为\"必要条件判断\"。 对reframed paper仍有价值：强化了\"operating regime is narrow\"的结论——\n    不仅需要diversity，还需要diversity来自有能力产生valid constraints的模型。\n\n    '\n- name: qwq_32b_operating_regime\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: QwQ-32B existing data formatted for operating regime analysis\n  expected_results:\n    aime_c0: 0.0\n    aime_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n    folio_c0: 0.0\n    folio_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n    proofwriter_c0: 0.1875\n    proofwriter_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n    combined_c0: 0.036\n    combined_sica_sc_gap: 0.0\n    n_total: 48\n    reasoning_model_conclusion: SICA structurally degenerates to SC\n  result_rationale: 'QwQ数据已存在且确认worst档预设：reasoning model的chain-of-thought过程 产生near-deterministic答案（temperature\n    sampling无法穿透reasoning chain的 self-correction机制）。C0=3.6%意味着在48题中仅1-2题出现过多候选答案，\n    且这些多候选情况可能是reasoning chain的中间犹豫而非genuine uncertainty。 SICA≡SC是数学必然：当只有1个candidate\n    answer时，MaxSAT无论怎么weight都选它。 这是worst档narrative的strongest evidence——\"method correctness\n    is irrelevant  when the operating regime doesn''t exist\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Reasoning vs Instruction Model Operating Regime'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Type\n    - Domain\n    - N\n    - C0\n    - SICA-SC Gap\n    rows:\n    - - QwQ-32B\n      - Reasoning\n      - AIME\n      - 22\n      - 0%\n      - 0.0pp\n    - - QwQ-32B\n      - Reasoning\n      - FOLIO\n      - 10\n      - 0%\n      - 0.0pp\n    - - QwQ-32B\n      - Reasoning\n      - ProofWriter\n      - 16\n      - 18.75%\n      - 0.0pp\n    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n      - Instruction\n      - FOLIO\n      - 30\n      - 40%\n      - +6.7pp\n    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n      - Instruction\n      - ProofWriter\n      - 30\n      - 63%\n      - 0.0pp\n    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n      - Instruction\n      - Combined\n      - 60\n      - 53%\n      - +3.3pp\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1 (main): Operating regime diagram — x-axis: C0 (trace diversity), y-axis:\n    SICA-SC gap. Reasoning models clustered at origin, instruction models spread along\n    x-axis but gap only positive for FOLIO subset'\n  analysis: 'QwQ data在worst档下从\"negative result配角\"升为\"主要贡献\"。 Framing：不是\"SICA在reasoning\n    model上失败\"，而是\"我们发现了一个fundamental architectural property——reasoning models的internal\n    self-consistency消除了 external consensus的操作空间\"。这个发现对ALL ensemble/consensus methods成立，\n    不限于SICA，是architecturally general的insight。 Paper中应作为Section 4的opening，建立\"operating\n    regime\"概念后再展示14B数据。\n\n    '\n- name: c0_diagnostic_validation\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: Plot C0 vs SICA-SC gap across all models and K values\n  expected_results:\n    n_datapoints: 12\n    pearson_r_c0_gap: 0.45\n    spearman_rho_c0_gap: 0.52\n    c0_threshold_for_positive_gap: 0.3\n    false_positive_rate: 0.25\n    false_negative_rate: 0.1\n    auc_c0_as_classifier: 0.72\n  result_rationale: '在worst档下，C0 vs gap的关系存在但不strong： - QwQ数据点（C0≈0, gap=0）锚定了左下角\n    - 14B-Instruct K=12 60题（C0=0.53, gap=3.3）是outlier（小样本噪声放大） - 14B-Instruct 804题（C0=0.28,\n    gap=0.7）落在中间偏低 - 7B（C0=0.65, gap=1.7）比14B 804题高但不如14B 60题 - K ablation各点散布较广 Pearson\n    r≈0.45说明C0解释了约20%的variance——有信号但不是strong predictor。 作为binary classifier（C0>0.3\n    → SICA有价值），AUC=0.72——比random好但远非 definitive。这将C0从\"precise diagnostic\"降级为\"rough\n    screening heuristic\"。 在worst档narrative中，这恰好支持\"characterization贡献\"而非\"practical\n    tool\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: C0 as Diagnostic — Correlation Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - C0\n    - Gap (pp)\n    - N\n    rows:\n    - - QwQ-32B Combined\n      - 0.036\n      - 0.0\n      - 48\n    - - 14B FOLIO-60\n      - 0.4\n      - 6.7\n      - 30\n    - - 14B PW-60\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.0\n      - 30\n    - - 14B Combined-60\n      - 0.53\n      - 3.3\n      - 60\n    - - 14B FOLIO-204\n      - 0.32\n      - 2.0\n      - 204\n    - - 14B PW-600\n      - 0.25\n      - -0.5\n      - 600\n    - - 14B Combined-804\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.7\n      - 804\n    - - 7B Combined-60\n      - 0.65\n      - 1.7\n      - 60\n    - - 14B K=6\n      - 0.4\n      - 1.7\n      - 60\n    - - 14B K=8\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.0\n      - 60\n    - - 14B K=16\n      - 0.55\n      - 1.7\n      - 60\n    - - 14B K=20\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.0\n      - 60\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Scatter plot C0 vs Gap with regression line — showing positive but weak\n    correlation (r=0.45), with ProofWriter points systematically below regression\n    line'\n  - 'Fig 9: C0 as binary classifier ROC curve (threshold sweep), AUC=0.72'\n  analysis: 'C0 diagnostic在worst档下的贡献从\"practical zero-cost tool\"退化为 \"necessary condition\n    identifier\"——C0<5%确实predicts gap=0（无false negatives in that range），但C0>30%不guarantee\n    positive gap（ProofWriter反例）。 Paper framing：C0的价值是快速排除不值得尝试的场景（reasoning models），\n    而非精确预测gain magnitude。这仍是有价值的practitioner insight， 但claim需要significantly weaken。\n\n    '\n- name: sica_72b_awq\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct AWQ 4-bit on 60 questions, K=12, T=0.7\n  expected_results:\n    sc_accuracy: 0.783\n    sica_accuracy: 0.783\n    sica_sc_gap_pp: 0.0\n    c0_multi_candidate_rate: 0.18\n    tie_fraction: 0.017\n    maxsat_exclusion_rate: 0.015\n    constraint_quality_score: 0.82\n    wall_time_hours: 3.5\n  result_rationale: '72B模型在worst档下表现接近reasoning model regime： 更强的instruction model更self-consistent（虽非reasoning\n    architecture， 但72B的internal representation足够强大以produce near-deterministic outputs）。\n    C0=18%接近worst档定义的lower bound，tie fraction仅1题（1.7%）。 高constraint quality（0.82）但无用武之地——当多数题12/12一致时，\n    即使constraints完美也无法改变outcome。Gap=0pp。 这对paper的贡献：在7B-14B-72B-QwQ的spectrum上， 展示了C0与model\n    capability的inverse relationship不限于reasoning vs instruction的 binary divide，而是continuous\n    spectrum。72B是\"instruction model approaching  reasoning model regime\"的evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5 (extended): Full Model Scaling'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Params\n    - Type\n    - SC Acc\n    - C0\n    - Gap (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\n      - 7B\n      - Instruction\n      - 58.3%\n      - '0.65'\n      - '+1.7'\n    - - Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct\n      - 14B\n      - Instruction\n      - 70.0%\n      - '0.53'\n      - '+3.3'\n    - - Qwen2.5-72B-Instruct-AWQ\n      - 72B\n      - Instruction\n      - 78.3%\n      - '0.18'\n      - '0.0'\n    - - QwQ-32B\n      - 32B\n      - Reasoning\n      - 72.7%\n      - '0.036'\n      - '0.0'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 10: Model scale vs C0 showing clear negative log-linear trend for instruction\n    models, with reasoning model as extreme endpoint'\n  analysis: '72B结果在worst档下是devastating for accuracy claim但excellent for characterization：\n    它证明SICA的operating regime不仅排除reasoning models，还排除sufficiently capable instruction\n    models。实际有效的窗口是\"14B-class instruction models on specific  diverse-inducing tasks\"——一个非常narrow的niche。\n    对reframed paper：这是operating regime分析的crown jewel数据点， 证明了regime narrowness是model\n    capability的函数而非architecture的binary。\n\n    '\n- name: constraint_quality_case_studies\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: Qualitative analysis of extracted constraints on 5-10 representative\n    questions\n  expected_results:\n    semantically_meaningful_rate: 0.55\n    trivially_correct_rate: 0.3\n    malformed_or_vacuous_rate: 0.15\n    exclusion_justified_rate: 0.7\n    case_study_n: 8\n    finding: Constraints are often restatements of the answer rather than independent\n      logical evidence\n  result_rationale: '在worst档下，constraint quality analysis揭示了SICA的deeper limitation：\n    多数extracted constraints不是独立于answer的logical evidence，而是answer的 reformulation（\"if\n    answer is A then X holds\" → tautological when answer IS A）。 真正的inter-answer constraints（\"A\n    and B cannot both be true because...\"）占少数。 MaxSAT exclusion（当它发生时）确实对应reasoning\n    errors（70% justified）， 但exclusion rate太低（2-3%）说明大多数constraints不互相矛盾—— 它们各自支持自己的answer而不cross-reference\n    other candidates。 这解释了为什么MaxSAT在非tie场景无法翻转majority：constraints是answer-local的，\n    不提供cross-answer的discriminative信号。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 11: Example constraint extraction showing tautological vs genuinely discriminative\n    constraints, with annotation of semantic categories'\n  analysis: 'Case studies在worst档下支持一个deep methodological critique： current constraint\n    extraction paradigm produces answer-local evidence而非 cross-answer comparative\n    evidence。这不是implementation bug而是architectural limitation——LLM traces naturally\n    argue FOR their conclusion而非AGAINST alternatives。 对reframed paper：这是\"why symbolic\n    consensus fails\"的mechanistic explanation， 升级为Section 5的核心内容。\n\n    '\n- name: overhead_analysis\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: 'Wall-time breakdown per question: generation, extraction, MaxSAT'\n  expected_results:\n    avg_total_time_per_question_s: 58.3\n    generation_fraction: 0.85\n    extraction_fraction: 0.12\n    maxsat_fraction: 0.03\n    overhead_vs_sc_multiplier: 1.15\n    extraction_api_calls_per_question: 12\n    maxsat_solve_time_ms: 45\n    overall_cost_multiplier_vs_sc: 2.2\n  result_rationale: 'Overhead analysis在worst档下呈现矛盾narrative： computational overhead其实不大（MaxSAT本身仅3%的时间），\n    主要cost是constraint extraction的额外LLM calls（每题12次extraction call， 约等于generation cost×1）。总cost是SC的2.2倍。\n    在gain=0.7pp且不显著的情况下，任何>1x的overhead都是cost-ineffective的。 但如果reframe为diagnostic tool，overhead的framing变化：\n    \"C0 computation需要0 overhead（只看SC投票分布）， full SICA pipeline的overhead仅在C0>threshold时才值得incur\"。\n    这支持了two-stage deployment strategy的practical recommendation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Computational Overhead Breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - Stage\n    - Avg Time (s)\n    - Fraction\n    - Cost vs SC\n    rows:\n    - - Generation (K=12 traces)\n      - 49.5\n      - 85%\n      - 1.0x (same as SC)\n    - - Constraint Extraction\n      - 7.0\n      - 12%\n      - +1.0x (12 LLM calls)\n    - - MaxSAT Solving\n      - 1.8\n      - 3%\n      - negligible\n    - - Total SICA\n      - 58.3\n      - 100%\n      - 2.2x vs SC\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 12: Stacked bar chart of per-question time breakdown, showing generation\n    dominates and MaxSAT is negligible'\n  analysis: Overhead结果在worst档下的silver lining：MaxSAT本身几乎free（45ms）， bottleneck完全在constraint\n    extraction的LLM calls。 这为future work开路：如果extraction可以更高效（batch, smaller model,  或integrated\n    into generation prompt），SICA的marginal cost可降至接近零。 对reframed paper：overhead不是致命弱点（不像some\n    symbolic methods需要 exponential time），而是engineering problem。主要weakness仍是regime\n    narrowness， 不是computational cost。\n","numLines":608,"startLine":1,"totalLines":608}}}
