seful?\n5. **Writing quality**: Is the paper well-written? Is the reframing from \"failure\" to \"diagnostic framework\" convincing?\n\nStructure your review as:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted)\n- Questions for Authors\n- Missing related work\n- Score and confidence\n\nBe critical but fair. This is a top venue with ~25% acceptance rate.","uuid":"f356fdbd-efe8-4e0d-a06f-c91d0e377ca4","session_id":"8f20b57d-9fbb-4d3c-afd1-df001eab1b14"}
